# Florist API — environment variable reference
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local development. On Railway / Render / any
# platform, set these as deployment-level environment variables.
#
# Required:
#   JWT_SECRET                 256-bit secret for signing access tokens.
#   MONGO_CONNECTION_STRING    MongoDB Atlas URI (overrides appsettings.json).
#
# Recommended on Railway / ephemeral containers:
#   UPLOADS_PATH               Absolute path on a mounted persistent volume
#                              where user-uploaded images live. Files here are
#                              served under /uploads/... by Program.cs and
#                              survive container redeploys.
#                              Example: /data/uploads
#                              Leave empty/unset to fall back to the bundled
#                              wwwroot/uploads/ directory.
#
# Optional:
#   CORS_ORIGINS               Semicolon-separated list of additional allowed
#                              frontend origins beyond the defaults baked into
#                              Program.cs (localhost + florist.vn + vercel.app).
#   JWT_ISSUER / JWT_AUDIENCE  Override JWT claim values (defaults in code).
